{"id":"e31fa4b66e2bc235","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/583_群体知识逻辑.md","title":"583 群体知识逻辑","display":"583_群体知识逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\\)</span> 为非空有限主体集合，并固定其线性序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{583}\">\\(&lt;_{583}\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。对任意集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K_a,E_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K_a,E_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>派生记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)\">\\(A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本文件的命题原子直接取命题名本身；原子记号固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p):=p\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p):=p\\)</span>。因此形成、自由符号、替换和满足子句中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\)</span> 是同一个公式对象。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(K_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_GA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(E_GA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<p>自由命题变元函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{583}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{583}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(K_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(E_GA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(K_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(E_GA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{583}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{583}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{583}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{583}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{583}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,583}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,583}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。有限支撑替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{583}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{583})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{583}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{583})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{583}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{583}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(B,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(B,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(K_aA,\\sigma)=K_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(E_GA,\\sigma)=E_G\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(K_aA,\\sigma)=K_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(E_GA,\\sigma)=E_G\\operatorname{Sub}_{583}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-群体展开公理\">4. 群体展开公理</h1>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enum}_{583,G}:k_G\\to G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enum}_{583,G}:k_G\\to G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{583}\">\\(&lt;_{583}\\)</span> 递增列出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的双射。对公式族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:G\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(B:G\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span>，定义有限合取</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conj}_{583}(G,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Conj}_{583}(G,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"k_G=1\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Conj}_{583}(G,B)=B(\\operatorname{enum}_{583,G}(0)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[k_G=1\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Conj}_{583}(G,B)=B(\\operatorname{enum}_{583,G}(0)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"k_G&gt;1\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Conj}_{583}(G,B)\n=\nB(\\operatorname{enum}_{583,G}(0))\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Conj}_{583}(G&#39;,B|_{G&#39;}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[k_G&gt;1\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Conj}_{583}(G,B)\n=\nB(\\operatorname{enum}_{583,G}(0))\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Conj}_{583}(G&#39;,B|_{G&#39;}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;=G\\setminus\\{\\operatorname{enum}_{583,G}(0)\\}\">\\(G&#39;=G\\setminus\\{\\operatorname{enum}_{583,G}(0)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{E}^{583}\n=\n\\{E_GA\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Conj}_{583}(G,B_{G,A}):\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{583},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{E}^{583}\n=\n\\{E_GA\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Conj}_{583}(G,B_{G,A}):\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{583},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{G,A}:G\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(B_{G,A}:G\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{G,A}(a)=K_aA\">\\(B_{G,A}(a)=K_aA\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-个体知识公理族\">5. 个体知识公理族</h1>\n<p>下列三个命题公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{583}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{583}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{583}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{583}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{583}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{583}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{583}=\\{K_a(A\\to B)\\to(K_aA\\to K_aB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{583}=\\{K_a(A\\to B)\\to(K_aA\\to K_aB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{583}=\\{K_aA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{583}=\\{K_aA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{583}=\\{K_aA\\to K_aK_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{583}=\\{K_aA\\to K_aK_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{583}=\\{\\neg K_aA\\to K_a\\neg K_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{583}=\\{\\neg K_aA\\to K_a\\neg K_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{583}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{583}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{583}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{583}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}}\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{583}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{583}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{583}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{583})\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{E}^{583}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{583}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{583}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{583}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{583}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}}\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{583}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{583}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{583}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{583})\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{E}^{583}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{583}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{583}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{583}=\\{((A),K_aA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{583}=\\{((A),K_aA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个主体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 定义；只允许从空依赖行使用。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{583}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{583}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{583}\\)</span>，并且每行至少满足下列 4 个条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{583}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{583}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{583}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{583}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{583}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{583}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{583}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{583}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\text{使 }\\pi\\text{ 的末行为 }(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{583}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{583}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\text{使 }\\pi\\text{ 的末行为 }(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目只加入群体“人人知道”算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_G\">\\(E_G\\)</span> 与展开公理；它不含公共知识固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_G\">\\(C_G\\)</span>，也不含分布知识算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_G\">\\(D_G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-关系语义载体与后承\">10. 关系语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>等价关系谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqRel}_{583}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\n\\wedge\n\\forall w\\in W\\ (w,w)\\in R\n\\wedge\n\\forall u,v\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow(v,u)\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EqRel}_{583}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\n\\wedge\n\\forall w\\in W\\ (w,w)\\in R\n\\wedge\n\\forall u,v\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow(v,u)\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\wedge\n\\forall u,v,z\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\wedge(v,z)\\in R\\Rightarrow(u,z)\\in R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\wedge\n\\forall u,v,z\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\wedge(v,z)\\in R\\Rightarrow(u,z)\\in R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>群体知识模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KMod}_{583}\n=\n\\{(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}},V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\\ \\operatorname{EqRel}_{583}(W,R_a),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KMod}_{583}\n=\n\\{(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}},V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\\ \\operatorname{EqRel}_{583}(W,R_a),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_{583}^{E,G}=\\bigcup_{a\\in G}R_a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_{583}^{E,G}=\\bigcup_{a\\in G}R_a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}},V)\\in\\mathsf{KMod}_{583}\">\\(M=(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}},V)\\in\\mathsf{KMod}_{583}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{583}p\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{583}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{583}p\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{583}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{583}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{583}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{583}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{583}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{583}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{583}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{583}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{583}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{583}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{583}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{583}K_aA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R_a\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{583}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{583}K_aA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R_a\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{583}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{583}E_GA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R_{583}^{E,G}\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{583}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{583}E_GA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R_{583}^{E,G}\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{583}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{583}^{\\mathsf K}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{583}^{\\mathsf K}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}},V)\\in\\mathsf{KMod}_{583}\">\\(M=(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}},V)\\in\\mathsf{KMod}_{583}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{583}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{583}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{583}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{583}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal EKnow_{583}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ag}_{583},\n&lt;_{583},\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{583},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{583},\n\\operatorname{Conj}_{583},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{583},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{583},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,583},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{583},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{583},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{583},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{583},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{583})_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{583},\n\\vdash_{583},\n\\operatorname{EqRel}_{583},\n\\mathsf{KMod}_{583},\nR_{583}^{E,G},\n\\models_{583},\n\\models_{583}^{\\mathsf K}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal EKnow_{583}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ag}_{583},\n&lt;_{583},\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{583},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{583},\n\\operatorname{Conj}_{583},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{583},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{583},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,583},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{583},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{583},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{583},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{583},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{583})_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{583},\n\\vdash_{583},\n\\operatorname{EqRel}_{583},\n\\mathsf{KMod}_{583},\nR_{583}^{E,G},\n\\models_{583},\n\\models_{583}^{\\mathsf K}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含群体知识句法、公理、规则、证明对象、可证性、Kripke 关系语义和语义后承；不含公共知识固定点构造子或完备性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-群体展开公理","text":"4. 群体展开公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-个体知识公理族","text":"5. 个体知识公理族","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-关系语义载体与后承","text":"10. 关系语义载体与后承","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{583}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{583}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K_a,E_G","display":true},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{583}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne G